{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=5135440&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-11-12T11:16:38Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"5135440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DPS: Desktop Pension Squad", "steam_appid": 5135440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5374820, 5367060, 5367070, 5403100], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/e154825e7d5fc887e51fb35b3524b171.avif?t=1794454225\" width=1080 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even while you're busy working or studying, your monsters' adventure never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your own squad, combine skills and equipment, and reclaim the Dungeon Cores stolen by humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/9eae7391010bdcae5b13d10ae7e57124.avif?t=1794454225\" width=780 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep the game running in the corner of your screen while you work, study, or watch videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your monster squad will automatically battle humans and collect chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Need more screen space? Simply minimize the game into Icon Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy this free-to-play desktop idle RPG and add a little adventure to your everyday routine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/204a5c5997303710a1866693dc1858e5.poster.avif?t=1794454225\" width=720 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/204a5c5997303710a1866693dc1858e5.webm?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/204a5c5997303710a1866693dc1858e5.mp4?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/1426b5966f633164db291688ffae979a.avif?t=1794454225\" width=780 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On every third attack, when an enemy is defeated, or when a target is marked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each skill activates automatically when its specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose which of each character's 8 unique skills to equip and experiment with different combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The skills you pair together can completely change how your squad fights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/dba8d8f4bb557165d6274381b47554d8.poster.avif?t=1794454225\" width=752 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/dba8d8f4bb557165d6274381b47554d8.webm?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/dba8d8f4bb557165d6274381b47554d8.mp4?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/04e78d13e18d9ab228201d52a425d2b0.avif?t=1794454225\" width=780 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your monsters keep fighting and collecting chests even while you're focused on other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Open chests to discover new equipment and make your monster squad even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Condense unwanted equipment and use the materials you've gathered to craft new gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Who knows? Your next chest might contain that legendary piece of equipment you've been waiting for!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/7aa0d8f4fd6dfba0226481ac156ff7b8.poster.avif?t=1794454225\" width=780 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/7aa0d8f4fd6dfba0226481ac156ff7b8.webm?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/7aa0d8f4fd6dfba0226481ac156ff7b8.mp4?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/d911fc8b0a0e44ce22c5d71e26eb0eb6.avif?t=1794454225\" width=780 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Equipment of Legendary rarity or higher can be transferred to your Steam Inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trade the equipment you've earned with other players through the Steam Community Market!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/b0898262d0e5b8d1c80a0b58114fb092.poster.avif?t=1794454225\" width=1040 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/b0898262d0e5b8d1c80a0b58114fb092.webm?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/b0898262d0e5b8d1c80a0b58114fb092.mp4?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/64d518cc887202bcf8f602b14aa798b4.avif?t=1794454225\" width=780 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Humans have stolen nearly every Dungeon Core, leaving only one remaining.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While the legion fights to protect the last Core, a band of monsters deemed unworthy of joining its ranks sets out to reclaim those that were lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/dcc8273e1b907698c3023dec2f9d7d6f.avif?t=1794454225\" width=780 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A former Labyrinth Lord and a one-armed sharpshooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A cowardly lich and a staff with an insatiable appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A sorrowful jester and a Grim Reaper who protects fellow monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather these unlikely heroes, each with their own story to tell, and form your own expedition squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From medieval knights to the armies of a desert pharaoh, new human forces stand in your way with every chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the Monsters on Their Twilight Expedition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/db27d06004d953763a2d1da7243ce656.poster.avif?t=1794454225\" width=1070 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/db27d06004d953763a2d1da7243ce656.webm?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/db27d06004d953763a2d1da7243ce656.mp4?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align