 Lord and a one-armed sharpshooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A cowardly lich and a staff with an insatiable appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A sorrowful jester and a Grim Reaper who protects fellow monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather these unlikely heroes, each with their own story to tell, and form your own expedition squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From medieval knights to the armies of a desert pharaoh, new human forces stand in your way with every chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Join the Monsters on Their Twilight Expedition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/db27d06004d953763a2d1da7243ce656.poster.avif?t=1794454225\" width=1070 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/db27d06004d953763a2d1da7243ce656.webm?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5135440/extras/db27d06004d953763a2d1da7243ce656.mp4?t=1794454225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>", "short_description": "A desktop idle RPG where monsters battle on their own while you work or study! Recruit a colorful cast of monsters, build your own squad, and reclaim the Dungeon Cores stolen by humans.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Russian, Vietnamese, Spanish - Latin America, Ukrainian, Indonesian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Thai, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Korean, Italian, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s